        "original_id": "db76e73c-0333-50b4-8fdf-6794d43b0bc7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Guy Davis, Guillermo del Toro, Burn Gorman, Matthew Robbins, Callum Greene, Jon Jashni, Thomas Tull, John Barrowman, Eve Myles, Naoko Mori, Gareth David Lloyd\n- Works: Pacific Rim, Crimson Peak, Torchwood, To the Last Man, Game of Thrones, The Dark Knight Rises\n- Roles: Dr. Owen Harper, Karl Tanner, Phillip Stryver, Dr. Hermann Gottlieb, Major Edmund Hewlett, Mr. Holly, Toshiko Sato\n\nFacts:\n- Burn Gorman played Dr. Owen Harper in the BBC series \"Torchwood\" from 2006 to 2008.\n- The \"Torchwood\" episode \"To the Last Man\" featured series regulars John Barrowman, Eve Myles, Burn Gorman, Naoko Mori, and Gareth David Lloyd, and it gave Naoko Mori's character Toshiko Sato the main focus.\n- Burn Gorman played Phillip Stryver in \"The Dark Knight Rises\" in 2012.\n- Guillermo del Toro collaborated with Guy Davis on the film \"Pacific Rim\" in 2013.\n- Burn Gorman played Dr. Hermann Gottlieb in \"Pacific Rim\" in 2013.\n- Burn Gorman played Karl Tanner in the HBO series \"Game of Thrones\" from 2013 to 2014.\n- Burn Gorman played Major Edmund Hewlett in an AMC series in 2014.\n- \"Crimson Peak\" is a 2015 American gothic romance film directed, co-produced, and co-written by Guillermo del Toro.\n- \"Crimson Peak\" was also co-produced by Callum Greene, Jon Jashni, and Thomas Tull, and co-written by Matthew Robbins.\n- Guillermo del Toro collaborated with Guy Davis on the film \"Crimson Peak\".\n- Burn Gorman played Mr. Holly in \"Crimson Peak\" in 2015.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
